# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Author: Daniel S.
# Date: 11/11/2026
# File: .gitignore
# Version: V1.1
# Description: Files Git should never track (venv, Python cache, secrets).
#              Comments must be on their own line, a "#" after a pattern
#              would become part of the pattern.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python Virtual Environments
.venv/
venv/
# Python's Compiled Cache Folders
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
# Compiled Python Files
*.pyc
# Real Passwords, Only .env.example Is Committed
.env
